# Check text files out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) produce CRLF files and
# `pnpm lint` fails on Biome's formatter for files that are LF in the index.
# Both developers must be able to run the same checks locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
